{"id":"655020","name":"馒头版肉夹馍","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/655020/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黑面馒头","amount":"1个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"小许"},{"name":"葱姜","amount":"小许"},{"name":"冰糖","amount":"些许"},{"name":"老抽","amount":"15g"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"10g"},{"name":"清水","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"1g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"五花肉冷水下锅煮。","img":"images/655020/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"煮好的五花肉凉透。","img":"images/655020/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"肉取出来切后天，切葱姜。","img":"images/655020/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"热锅冷油。","img":"images/655020/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"油热放冰糖。","img":"images/655020/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"炒出糖色。","img":"images/655020/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放回锅肉和葱姜，肉煎至两面金黄。","img":"images/655020/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放食盐。","img":"images/655020/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放老抽和生抽。","img":"images/655020/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"炒均匀。","img":"images/655020/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放清水，水面跟食材持平。中火炖煮。","img":"images/655020/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"烧肉的同时取黑面馒头，切成馒头夹。","img":"images/655020/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"一个馒头切了2个。","img":"images/655020/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"鸡蛋洗净磕碗里搅散，放馒头夹，裹满蛋液。","img":"images/655020/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"热锅刷油。","img":"images/655020/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放馒头夹。","img":"images/655020/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"剩余的蛋液也煎熟。","img":"images/655020/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"切大葱。如果能吃辣，最好用辣椒，味道更好一些。","img":"images/655020/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"煎好的蛋跟大葱放一起。","img":"images/655020/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"馒头夹两面煎金黄取出来。","img":"images/655020/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"烧肉的汤汁不多的时候放鸡精提鲜。","img":"images/655020/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"烧好的回锅肉。","img":"images/655020/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"取一块。","img":"images/655020/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"跟大葱鸡蛋一起剁成末。","img":"images/655020/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"放馒头夹里即可。","img":"images/655020/step_25.jpg"},{"step":26,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/655020/step_26.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}